</parameterlist>
Pressure derivatives of <formula id="111">$ n_1, n_2 $</formula>: the expressions of n1n2_Tstar_V, differentiated analytically.</para>
<para>Needed for the chain rule of the density derivatives through <formula id="149">$ T^*_V = n_1 + n_2 T $</formula> (C12, LIB-25).</para>
